<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Poison Sphere</h1>
<p>The spells of the poison sphere work from inside the body: poisons and plagues, the necromancers' foul gases and clouds, madness and energy drain, and also the cures, remove poison and remove disease. Your ability in the sphere decides how well you cast them, and also how well you resist poison spells cast on you (see <a cmd='#'>Help Spheres</a>). To resist poison better, see <a cmd='#'>Help Poison Resistance</a>; dragons may also breathe gas (see <a cmd='#'>Help Breath</a>).
</p><p>The spells, and who teaches them (guild level):
</p>
<pre>toxicate          assassin 20, sorcerer 37
remove poison     healer 13, druid 28
energy drain      necromancer 38, dark knight 85
madness           necromancer 7
plague            dark knight 20, necromancer 25
remove disease    healer 11, paladin 20, druid 25
gas breath        no guild teaches it
poison ivy        druid 9
fart              necromancer 1
bad breath        necromancer 16
stinking cloud    necromancer 30
stinking breath   necromancer 100
</pre>
<p>Each spell has its own help: help and the spell's name.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Spheres</a>
